---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE_NAME } from '../lib/jobs';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About & Editorial Methodology"
  description={`Learn how ${SITE_NAME} structures, verifies, and links official public-sector recruitment notices without speculation or hidden forms.`}
  canonicalPath="/about"
>
  <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-4 text-xs text-ink-secondary">
    <ol class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
      <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-accent hover:underline">Home</a></li>
      <li aria-hidden="true">/</li>
      <li aria-current="page" class="text-ink font-medium">About</li>
    </ol>
  </nav>

  <article class="max-w-3xl bg-surface border border-border-strong rounded-[3px] p-5 sm:p-7 space-y-5">
    <header class="border-b border-border pb-4 space-y-2">
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink tracking-tight">
        About {SITE_NAME}
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-ink-secondary leading-[1.6]">
        An independent public-sector recruitment notice index built for clarity,
        accessibility, and source transparency.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="space-y-2.5 text-sm text-ink leading-[1.6]">
      <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-ink">1. Editorial Mission</h2>
      <p>
        Official recruitment circulars are frequently distributed as dense multi-page
        PDFs across dozens of ministry, commission, railway zone, and autonomous
        institute portals. {SITE_NAME} standardizes key recruitment facts—deadlines,
        vacancy distributions, age cutoffs, fee schedules, and direct application
        URLs—into uniform scannable tables.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-2.5 text-sm text-ink leading-[1.6]">
      <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-ink">2. Zero-Guessing Verification Standard</h2>
      <p>
        We do not estimate salaries, round deadlines, or invent eligibility criteria.
        If an official notification omits a field (such as a separate PDF circular or an
        exact closing time), the field is explicitly marked as{' '}
        <span class="font-mono text-xs bg-canvas border border-border px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-sm">
          Visit Official Site
        </span>
        . Every notice includes the issuing domain and a UTC verification timestamp.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-2.5 text-sm text-ink leading-[1.6]">
      <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-ink">3. Direct Application Policy</h2>
      <p>
        {SITE_NAME} is not affiliated with any government agency. We never accept
        applications, store candidate documents, or collect examination fees. Every job
        detail page links directly to the issuing organization&apos;s official portal
        and notification PDF.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
